  "description": "I'm the Gingerbread House witch! \n\nI possessed Yielle Frank, the witch from Hansel and Gretel! I didn't want to die like in the original story, so I took good care of the children and sent them off. But ten years later, Hansel returns, all grown up... \n\n*\"Am I still just a kid to you? Please don't run away.\"* \n\n(Source: Manta)",
